X: 1
T: Tourdion
T: Quand je bois du vin clairet
C: Anonymous, published by Pierre Attaingnant (1530)
O: France, 16th century
N: A drinking song set as a tourdion, the quick triple dance that followed
N: the basse danse. Melody and chords taken from the four-voice setting
N: (Guido Gonzato's transcription, abcplus.sourceforge.net), transposed up
N: a fifth for recorder range; the chords are what the lower three voices sing.
L: 1/8
Q: 3/8=106
M: 6/8
K: Bm
